[node name="InstructionsLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="HowToPlayModal/Panel/VBoxContainer/ScrollContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
size_flags_vertical = 3
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]Goal:[/b]
Balance your realm and survive as many [b]Days and Hours[/b] as possible!

[b]Decision Blocks & Context:[/b]
• Each scenario starts with [b]1–2 Story Cards[/b] describing the situation, location, and background. Swipe left/right or click NEXT/PREV to read.
• The final card of each block is the [b]Decision Card[/b].

[b]Knowing Actions & Affected Indicators:[/b]
• On the Decision Card, available actions (e.g., 'Pass Tax Reform') and their affected indicator icons are clearly listed [u]before[/u] you swipe.
• Left/Right choices are always available. Up/Down choices appear when extra decisions exist!
• As you drag, top glowing markers highlight affected indicators without revealing delta values or direction.

[b]Time Tracking:[/b]
• Each decision block advances time by [b]6 hours to 3 days (72h)[/b].
• Score is tracked and displayed in Days and Hours."

